and Dots (B) suits have better connectivity potential. I already have T7-T8-T9 chow and B3-B4-B5 chow forming, with B8 pair. Discarding W1 maintains maximum flexibility for drawing tiles that complete additional melds in my stronger suits.\n\nAnswer: Play W1"}
